WEBVTT

01:15.780 --> 01:19.950
[Yi'ang]

02:56.510 --> 03:00.270
[Born with Luck]

03:00.370 --> 03:03.200
[Episode 24]

03:08.910 --> 03:11.110
I did swindle Zhou Rong out of 30 million

03:12.150 --> 03:13.560
to pay my gambling debts.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.130
I'm guilty.

03:25.470 --> 03:26.130
That's all.

03:28.630 --> 03:29.360
You did more.

03:39.470 --> 03:40.960
My greed has led to

03:42.790 --> 03:45.120
a terribly negative impact on the society

03:45.240 --> 03:46.640
and caused grave trouble

03:47.030 --> 03:48.360
for the police.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.060
I'm guilty.

03:55.329 --> 03:56.460
Really, that's all.

04:00.550 --> 04:02.350
Why don't you give me a reminder?

04:06.120 --> 04:06.580
Ye Jian.

04:13.910 --> 04:14.790
Well...

04:15.430 --> 04:17.310
I-I need one more reminder.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.269
Yesterday, before Lu Yibo

04:21.269 --> 04:22.800
went for the bianzhong deal,

04:22.800 --> 04:24.490
he told Zhou Qi...

04:25.950 --> 04:26.950
Go find Lang Bowen

04:27.010 --> 04:28.210
and ask him to help me.

04:29.120 --> 04:30.180
Just tell him

04:30.350 --> 04:31.390
I will definitely not tell anyone

04:31.390 --> 04:32.390
about what happened

04:32.390 --> 04:34.070
on the night Ye Jian died.

04:34.240 --> 04:35.640
Ask him to please help me.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.840
What exactly happened

04:38.870 --> 04:40.270
on the night Ye Jian died?

04:44.120 --> 04:44.480
Fine.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.940
I'll give you one last tip.

04:46.630 --> 04:48.120
How would I dare lie to you?

04:48.190 --> 04:49.650
Everything I said is true.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.659
Where is Bowen?

04:51.560 --> 04:53.120
He got drunk and left.

04:58.159 --> 04:59.510
If you don't believe me, I'll call him

04:59.510 --> 05:00.510
so you can ask him.

05:00.830 --> 05:01.560
Call him now!

05:03.310 --> 05:04.720
So Ye Jian called you?

05:08.500 --> 05:12.680
Don't tell him, everybody.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.750
Hurry! Catch him quickly!

05:15.810 --> 05:19.810
Hurry! Catch him quickly!

05:16.910 --> 05:21.200
[Lu Yibo]

05:23.120 --> 05:23.560
Yes.

05:24.950 --> 05:26.510
Ye used Yibo's phone

05:27.160 --> 05:27.510
and

05:28.270 --> 05:29.070
gave me a call.

05:30.040 --> 05:31.440
What did he want with you?

05:31.480 --> 05:33.340
He just asked me about that watch.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.860
I told him I had given it to Lu Yibo.

05:39.720 --> 05:40.360
Then,

05:40.800 --> 05:42.100
Ye asked me about

05:42.190 --> 05:43.830
what happened to Lu Zheng that day.

05:43.830 --> 05:44.480
Ye was my good friend,

05:44.480 --> 05:45.659
so I told the truth.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.870
He then hung up the phone.

05:51.159 --> 05:52.600
After that,

05:53.040 --> 05:54.570
I got more and more worried.

05:54.750 --> 05:55.560
So, I called

05:55.560 --> 05:56.310
Zhou Rong.

05:56.900 --> 05:58.150
You called Zhou Rong?

05:59.159 --> 06:00.120
That was because...

06:00.120 --> 06:01.850
Did you also tell him the truth?

06:02.560 --> 06:03.890
How would I dare to do so?

06:03.950 --> 06:04.800
I just told him

06:04.800 --> 06:06.630
Ye found out what happened to Lu Zheng.

06:06.630 --> 06:07.430
When Zhou Rong

06:08.000 --> 06:08.930
was on the phone,

06:09.000 --> 06:10.300
were his emotion

06:10.680 --> 06:11.240
and tone

06:12.120 --> 06:13.120
the same as usual?

06:13.270 --> 06:14.950
At first, he was quite calm.

06:15.800 --> 06:17.720
Then, as I brought up about Lu Zheng,

06:17.720 --> 06:18.720
he went livid.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.830
He started throwing and smashing stuff.

06:20.830 --> 06:21.560
Are you sure

06:21.560 --> 06:23.160
you told him about the watch?

06:24.920 --> 06:25.430
Yes.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.610
Anything wrong?

06:27.920 --> 06:28.650
It seems odd.

06:30.510 --> 06:31.830
Given Zhou Rong's

06:31.830 --> 06:32.630
temperament,

06:33.120 --> 06:34.580
if he knew

06:34.750 --> 06:36.870
that watch could be evidence,

06:37.360 --> 06:39.150
would he have let Lu Yibo wear it

06:39.360 --> 06:41.360
and walk around for such a long time?

06:47.460 --> 06:49.540
I guess I probably told him about it.

06:50.750 --> 06:52.190
I have a bad memory.

06:52.480 --> 06:53.940
Your memory is never good.

06:55.680 --> 06:56.720
See if this is the truth:

06:56.720 --> 06:58.000
Zhou Rong actually ordered you

06:58.000 --> 06:59.780
to retrieve the phone

06:59.830 --> 07:00.920
and kill those two people.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.920
But you didn't plan to do any of that.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.650
You were there for the deal.

07:05.040 --> 07:05.600
I heard you meant

07:05.600 --> 07:06.870
to take 5 million out of your own pocket

07:06.870 --> 07:08.240
to pay those guys and have them

07:08.240 --> 07:10.440
leave Sanjiangkou as soon as possible.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.070
Why?

07:13.310 --> 07:14.360
It feels like

07:14.600 --> 07:16.000
you were eager to get the phone back

07:16.000 --> 07:17.530
and put this matter behind.

07:18.040 --> 07:18.800
That phone wouldn't

07:18.800 --> 07:19.860
cause you any harm.

07:20.560 --> 07:21.620
Why did you want it?

07:23.270 --> 07:23.830
Were you worried

07:23.830 --> 07:26.360
-that if we got the phone...
-I killed Ye Jian.

07:38.070 --> 07:38.920
Now that your investigation

07:38.920 --> 07:39.920
has gone this far,

07:41.159 --> 07:41.960
I might as well

07:43.040 --> 07:44.000
tell the truth.

07:44.970 --> 07:47.460
[Lu Yibo]

08:02.190 --> 08:02.880
Ye,

08:03.510 --> 08:05.650
this must be kept secret from Mr. Zhou.

08:07.000 --> 08:07.830
Listen up!

08:09.190 --> 08:10.520
It's too noisy on your end.

08:10.520 --> 08:11.980
Let's talk face-to-face.

08:13.000 --> 08:14.130
Meet me in Binhe Park

08:14.830 --> 08:15.720
by the creek

08:15.720 --> 08:16.720
we used to swim in.

08:16.750 --> 08:17.950
I'll be on the way now.

09:29.440 --> 09:29.870
Where

09:30.480 --> 09:31.320
is the car now?

09:32.720 --> 09:33.990
In my garage.

09:39.720 --> 09:40.270
Chief.

09:40.570 --> 09:41.970
We found biology traces.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.640
Go back and get some rest.

09:43.910 --> 09:45.640
I'll wait here for the results.

09:50.310 --> 09:51.400
Why did Lang Bowen

09:51.440 --> 09:52.510
kill a man

09:52.510 --> 09:53.710
in such a strange way?

09:54.550 --> 09:55.200
I did some analysis.

09:55.200 --> 09:55.930
First of all,

09:56.240 --> 09:57.240
Given his skills,

09:57.240 --> 09:58.360
it must be hard for him to fight

09:58.360 --> 09:59.360
and kill Ye alone.

09:59.720 --> 10:00.600
Second,

10:01.630 --> 10:02.790
they were childhood friends.

10:02.790 --> 10:04.080
With the means he choice,

10:04.080 --> 10:05.740
he didn't have to confront Ye.

10:17.960 --> 10:18.890
It's a sunny day.

10:20.630 --> 10:21.290
Time to eat!

10:56.980 --> 10:58.420
[Zhou Rong] [Hu Jianren] [Lang Bowen]

10:58.420 --> 11:00.240
[Li Penggai] [Lu Yibo] [Zhou Qi]

11:00.260 --> 11:02.810
[Zheng Yongbing] [Liu Bei]

11:02.810 --> 11:04.290
[Mao Hongwei] [Xia Tinggang]

11:04.310 --> 11:05.910
[A stone with "Yi'ang" written on it]

11:05.940 --> 11:06.650
[Fenglinwan Hotel Pub]

11:06.650 --> 11:09.220
[Ye Jian] [Lu Zheng]

11:17.140 --> 11:18.940
Chief Zhang, the results are in.

11:19.480 --> 11:20.410
It's Ye's blood.

11:22.840 --> 11:23.950
Has the murder weapon been found?

11:23.950 --> 11:24.720
Not yet.

11:25.240 --> 11:26.320
According to the recovery team,

11:26.320 --> 11:27.740
it was likely brought to the downstream
by the water,

11:27.740 --> 11:29.320
with slim chances of finding it.

11:29.320 --> 11:30.120
But Dr. Chen

11:30.120 --> 11:31.910
and the experts
from the Provincial Department

11:31.910 --> 11:33.360
all think Captain Ye died the way

11:33.360 --> 11:34.620
Lang Bowen described.

11:34.670 --> 11:36.860
[Zhou Rong] [Hu Jianren] [Lang Bowen]

11:35.120 --> 11:36.550
If Lang Bowen were not the murderer,

11:36.550 --> 11:38.200
He couldn't possibly know that.

11:38.200 --> 11:39.270
Besides, in that SUV,

11:39.270 --> 11:40.080
only Lang Bowen's

11:40.080 --> 11:41.390
and Lang Botu's fingerprints were found.

11:41.390 --> 11:43.120
So, the murderer is Lang Bowen.

11:49.150 --> 11:49.960
Lang Bowen

11:50.840 --> 11:52.520
spoke of a cutting board.

11:54.060 --> 11:56.060
It is no easy job to make such a thing.

11:58.010 --> 11:59.870
Suppose Lang Bowen killed Ye Jian

12:02.120 --> 12:03.320
in the heat of passion

12:04.030 --> 12:05.030
like he said,

12:06.000 --> 12:07.140
then how did he

12:08.200 --> 12:09.530
get that cutting board?

12:12.330 --> 12:13.110
What's more,

12:13.790 --> 12:15.450
he had the guts to kill Ye Jian,

12:15.870 --> 12:17.150
yet he would rather

12:17.150 --> 12:18.000
pay 5 million

12:18.000 --> 12:20.200
than go after those two street loafers.

12:20.600 --> 12:21.400
Don't you find

12:22.120 --> 12:23.250
this logic strange?

12:23.960 --> 12:25.440
But now, all the testimonies

12:25.440 --> 12:26.080
and the chain of evidence

12:26.080 --> 12:27.200
point to no one but Lang Bowen

12:27.200 --> 12:28.000
as the killer.

12:39.120 --> 12:39.720
Li Qian.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.510
Who is Yangyang?

12:42.270 --> 12:43.190
[I went to take a shower
and I remember this clearly]

12:43.190 --> 12:43.590
[I felt terrible in the shower,
and Yangyang came in to take care of me]

12:44.670 --> 12:45.400
Yangyang...

12:46.000 --> 12:47.530
It's Lang Botu's nickname.

12:47.670 --> 12:48.270
Thank you.

12:51.000 --> 12:51.600
"Yang..."

12:54.670 --> 12:55.400
"Yangyang."

12:56.840 --> 12:57.480
"Yi'ang."

12:58.710 --> 13:04.000
♪ Doubt ♪

13:05.160 --> 13:06.350
[Yi'ang]

13:06.280 --> 13:11.820
♪ Doubt ♪

13:06.790 --> 13:07.520
"Yi'ang..."

13:14.110 --> 13:28.750
♪ Doubt, doubt the doubt ♪

13:15.160 --> 13:18.230
[Yang]

13:26.550 --> 13:27.270
"Yi'ang."

13:30.240 --> 13:30.960
"Yi-ang."

13:31.510 --> 13:32.150
"Yang."

13:33.960 --> 13:34.870
Ye Jian wrote my name

13:34.870 --> 13:35.630
on the stone not because

13:35.630 --> 13:37.360
he hoped I could solve the case.

13:37.750 --> 13:38.600
It is pinyin.

13:38.870 --> 13:40.070
"Yi'ang."

13:40.790 --> 13:42.080
Read "Yi" and "Yang" fast,

13:42.080 --> 13:43.340
and you'll get "Yang."

13:43.720 --> 13:44.450
"Yangyang."

13:45.080 --> 13:46.340
It refers to Lang Botu.

13:48.580 --> 13:50.200
Whether Lang Botu killed him or not,

13:50.200 --> 13:50.890
the murderer

13:50.890 --> 13:52.550
was probably still at the scene.

13:52.550 --> 13:54.030
Ye Jian feared that the murderer

13:54.030 --> 13:55.360
might see him leave a clue,

13:55.360 --> 13:56.200
so he used my name

13:56.200 --> 13:58.340
as pinyin to give us a hint.

13:58.550 --> 13:59.960
"Yi'ang" and "Yang."

14:00.550 --> 14:01.280
"Yangyang."

14:02.040 --> 14:02.900
It's Lang Botu.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.000
His fingerprints

14:05.000 --> 14:06.200
were found in the SUV.

14:07.390 --> 14:08.790
He is highly suspicious.

14:10.000 --> 14:11.240
Improbable, Chief Zhang.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.030
As far as I know,

14:12.030 --> 14:12.790
this boy rarely engages

14:12.790 --> 14:13.630
himself in their business.

14:13.630 --> 14:14.690
How could it be him?

14:17.390 --> 14:18.250
Call Lang Botu.

14:34.120 --> 14:34.920
Hello.

14:38.870 --> 14:39.600
Yes, it's me.

14:41.360 --> 14:42.890
I'm heading to the airport.

14:44.840 --> 14:45.750
He's flying abroad

14:45.750 --> 14:46.630
at 2 p.m. today.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.390
With his elder brother in detention,

14:48.390 --> 14:49.990
he's going abroad right now?

14:51.440 --> 14:52.440
It's no surprise.

14:52.960 --> 14:54.240
Isn't he supposed to go abroad

14:54.240 --> 14:55.510
for postgraduate studies?

14:55.510 --> 14:56.910
He received his acceptance letter
long time ago

14:56.910 --> 14:58.080
and got his visa done.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.600
The program starts
on the 10th of next month.

14:59.600 --> 15:01.440
Maybe he's going overseas
a few days earlier

15:01.440 --> 15:02.300
to rent a place?

15:03.080 --> 15:03.610
Stop him.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.480
On what grounds?

15:05.630 --> 15:07.600
He is suspected of murdering Ye Jian.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.000
Got it.

15:10.750 --> 15:12.950
Shall we interrogate Lang Bowen again?

15:13.980 --> 15:15.240
Yes, make a call for it.

15:22.600 --> 15:23.000
Hello.

15:23.240 --> 15:25.900
Chief Zhang asks
to interrogate Lang Bowen now.

15:26.150 --> 15:26.750
Right now.

15:29.080 --> 15:29.670
When?

15:32.620 --> 15:33.420
Is it serious?

15:35.170 --> 15:36.500
What did the doctor say?

15:39.840 --> 15:40.440
Thank you.

15:41.790 --> 15:43.240
Lang Bowen has been sent
to the People's Hospital

15:43.240 --> 15:44.080
due to intestinal obstruction.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.390
How did that suddenly happen?

15:45.390 --> 15:46.390
He choked on food.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.910
The doctor said he's fine

15:47.910 --> 15:48.600
and prescribed anti-inflammatory medicine

15:48.600 --> 15:49.480
and two bags of glucose.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.550
Lang Bowen is on IVs now.

15:50.550 --> 15:50.910
What a coincidence.

15:50.910 --> 15:51.670
A great coincidence, isn't it?

15:51.670 --> 15:52.750
He pulled the same trick

15:52.750 --> 15:54.000
in prison before.

15:54.120 --> 15:56.320
He deliberately chocked on food
till intestinal obstruction happened.

15:56.320 --> 15:57.030
Then he was sent to the infirmary,

15:57.030 --> 15:58.510
and cured by a tube of glycerin.

15:58.510 --> 16:00.910
He did it
only to chat with the nurses there.

16:04.520 --> 16:06.100
How long will the IVs take?

16:06.960 --> 16:08.600
It takes 4 hours
to finish 2 bags of glucose.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.400
Four hours...

16:09.960 --> 16:10.760
Four hours...

16:11.270 --> 16:12.330
What time is it now?

16:14.790 --> 16:16.550
The process will end at about 2:00.

16:16.550 --> 16:17.150
That is...

16:17.840 --> 16:19.700
when Lang Botu's flight take off.

16:22.380 --> 16:23.790
There is another situation.

16:23.790 --> 16:25.440
Lang Bowen has been inquiring

16:25.440 --> 16:26.460
about today's weather

16:26.460 --> 16:27.460
since yesterday.

16:28.360 --> 16:30.320
He was afraid
that the flight wouldn't take off.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.910
There must be something wrong.

16:31.910 --> 16:32.910
What should we do?

16:32.920 --> 16:33.550
After all,

16:33.550 --> 16:34.750
Lang Bowen is a patient now.

16:34.750 --> 16:35.750
Is it appropriate to get him back

16:35.750 --> 16:37.010
f-for interrogation?

16:37.030 --> 16:39.320
Two 500 ml bags of glucose take 4 hours

16:39.320 --> 16:40.510
if infused slowly,

16:41.030 --> 16:42.430
and 3 if infused quickly.

16:43.150 --> 16:43.750
That could give us

16:43.750 --> 16:44.880
a window of one hour.

17:04.980 --> 17:06.579
Why is the fluid level so low?

17:08.550 --> 17:09.410
What's with it?

17:09.960 --> 17:11.619
This might cause an embolism.

17:12.030 --> 17:12.760
Don't move.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.680
What are you looking at?

17:20.550 --> 17:21.420
You perv.

17:21.510 --> 17:21.960
No.

17:22.910 --> 17:24.369
I'm looking at your watch.

17:25.310 --> 17:27.380
[Infusion Room]

17:27.380 --> 17:29.080
[Please keep quiet]

17:36.510 --> 17:37.110
Thank you.

17:52.830 --> 17:53.760
He's over there.

17:54.180 --> 17:56.060
[Washroom]

17:56.440 --> 17:57.510
Have you noticed the airport police?

17:57.510 --> 17:58.060
Yes.

17:58.800 --> 18:01.840
[First Class & Business Class Only]

18:02.080 --> 18:05.410
[First Class & Business Class Only]

18:08.770 --> 18:10.910
[First Class & Business Class Only]

18:12.070 --> 18:12.650
Hello.

18:12.720 --> 18:13.590
We've notified the police station

18:13.590 --> 18:14.450
in the airport.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.510
Okay, just a second.

18:16.510 --> 18:17.240
Let me check.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.240
Please make it quick.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.160
Three officers in total, right?

18:25.160 --> 18:25.560
Right.

18:27.270 --> 18:28.350
Please go through security check.

18:28.350 --> 18:29.150
Okay. Thanks.

18:30.720 --> 18:33.660
[Infusion Room]

18:36.240 --> 18:36.690
Wait.

18:36.720 --> 18:37.120
Nurse,

18:38.400 --> 18:39.400
there's much liquid left.

18:39.400 --> 18:39.800
Why...

18:40.030 --> 18:41.240
are you replacing it so soon?

18:41.240 --> 18:43.370
Are you the nurse or am I the nurse here?

18:44.790 --> 18:45.750
Please don't be mad.

18:45.750 --> 18:48.200
I was looking at your watch just now.

18:53.160 --> 18:55.240
How long will it take
to finish this bottle?

18:55.240 --> 18:56.040
About an hour.

19:03.310 --> 19:10.770
[Man]

19:52.510 --> 19:53.040
Officer.

19:53.350 --> 19:53.880
Officer!

19:54.920 --> 19:55.980
What time is it now?

20:01.200 --> 20:02.330
Two o'clock, right?

20:07.790 --> 20:09.820
Please have the nurse remove my IV.

20:10.240 --> 20:11.640
I want to see Chief Zhang.

20:17.000 --> 20:19.200
Good afternoon, ladies and gentlemen.

20:19.240 --> 20:21.030
This is a pre-boarding announcement

20:21.030 --> 20:23.030
for Flight ML4420

20:23.030 --> 20:24.070
passengers.

20:24.110 --> 20:25.790
Please have your boarding pass

20:25.790 --> 20:27.460
and identification ready.

20:27.880 --> 20:29.550
Regular boarding will begin

20:29.550 --> 20:31.400
in approximately 10 minutes.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.610
Chief Zhang.

20:39.200 --> 20:40.000
I lied.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.090
What did you lie about?

20:42.350 --> 20:43.680
I didn't kill Ye Jian.

20:49.200 --> 20:51.260
You spoke clearly about the details.

20:51.400 --> 20:52.700
Who else other than you
would have killed him?

20:52.700 --> 20:54.000
I don't know who did it,

20:54.070 --> 20:55.400
but it really wasn't me.

20:55.510 --> 20:56.670
T-The details...

20:56.830 --> 20:58.200
I made them all up.

20:59.160 --> 21:00.560
W-Was I right about them?

21:00.680 --> 21:02.010
But I was just guessing.

21:02.030 --> 21:02.790
You...

21:02.790 --> 21:04.190
I can prove I'm innocent.

21:05.110 --> 21:06.070
From my home...

21:06.120 --> 21:07.440
You know where I live, right?

21:07.440 --> 21:09.980
[Stick to the truth,
follow the law in handling cases]

21:08.310 --> 21:09.960
From my home to Binhe Park,

21:10.000 --> 21:13.180
[Remain committed to strict, fair,
and civilized law enforcement]

21:10.070 --> 21:11.590
one has to pass through Jiefang Road,

21:11.590 --> 21:12.150
right?

21:12.750 --> 21:15.070
Then, leave Jiefang West Road
for the Second Ring Road.

21:15.070 --> 21:16.200
Exit from Xiangcheng Road.

21:16.200 --> 21:17.550
After that, just go straight
to Binhe Park.

21:17.550 --> 21:17.960
Right?

21:19.590 --> 21:20.790
Do you remember this?

21:21.440 --> 21:23.100
On the night Ye died, there was

21:23.680 --> 21:24.400
a joint operation

21:24.400 --> 21:26.330
against drunk driving in the city.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.310
The police set up checkpoints

21:28.310 --> 21:29.770
at all the intersections.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.830
That night,

21:33.480 --> 21:34.510
I was blotto.

21:35.350 --> 21:37.350
There's no way you'd have missed me.

21:39.400 --> 21:40.720
We collected the fingerprints

21:40.720 --> 21:41.440
of two people

21:41.440 --> 21:42.390
on the SUV—

21:42.880 --> 21:43.680
only two.

21:44.750 --> 21:45.680
One was from you;

21:46.160 --> 21:47.890
another one was from Lang Botu.

21:48.270 --> 21:49.530
If you didn't kill him,

21:50.190 --> 21:51.990
would Lang Botu be the murderer?

21:55.110 --> 21:57.130
He's just a kid.

21:57.510 --> 21:58.480
There's no way he'd have

21:58.480 --> 21:59.540
the guts to do this.

22:00.030 --> 22:00.590
Besides,

22:00.830 --> 22:01.960
why would he kill Ye?

22:03.400 --> 22:04.530
Why would he kill Ye?

22:09.110 --> 22:10.570
If you really suspect him,

22:11.200 --> 22:13.240
just ask him to come over for an inquiry.

22:13.240 --> 22:14.640
But I guess it's too late.

22:15.400 --> 22:17.260
His flight has already taken off.

22:18.550 --> 22:19.350
Can we make it?

22:21.270 --> 22:21.900
Yes.

22:21.960 --> 22:23.590
There are 20 minutes left
before it takes off.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.720
That's impossible.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.810
His flight left at 2 PM.

22:27.240 --> 22:29.170
It's been airborne for 40 minutes.

22:30.110 --> 22:31.570
Of course we know you lied.

22:31.750 --> 22:33.080
I also know why you lied.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.070
You were buying time

22:34.070 --> 22:36.000
to cover for your younger brother.

22:36.920 --> 22:37.640
I'm sorry.

22:38.400 --> 22:39.350
We also lied.

22:39.070 --> 22:40.450
[13:40]

22:39.750 --> 22:40.960
It's 1:40 PM now.

22:43.990 --> 22:44.670
Copy that.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.040
Lang Botu.

22:48.500 --> 22:50.060
[Police]

22:48.680 --> 22:50.590
You are suspected of killing Ye Jian.

22:50.590 --> 22:53.200
Please come with me
to the bureau for the investigation.

22:53.200 --> 22:53.920
I am now

22:53.920 --> 22:55.310
arresting you for your suspicion

22:55.310 --> 22:56.640
of intentional murder.

22:57.750 --> 22:59.210
There are too many people.

22:59.680 --> 23:00.410
Come with us.

23:01.510 --> 23:01.920
Go.

23:06.310 --> 23:07.040
Chief Zhang!

23:07.070 --> 23:07.800
Chief Zhang!

23:08.240 --> 23:09.510
Chief Zhang, I... I lied again!

23:09.510 --> 23:10.070
Chief Zhang!

23:10.070 --> 23:10.830
I killed Ye Jian!

23:10.830 --> 23:11.920
I really killed him!

23:11.920 --> 23:13.640
There was a serious traffic jam
that night!

23:13.640 --> 23:14.440
Once I was stuck in traffic,

23:14.440 --> 23:15.590
I just took the alleys

23:15.590 --> 23:16.950
and didn't get checked!

23:17.200 --> 23:18.070
Zhang Yi'ang!

23:20.960 --> 23:22.960
I lied again. Trust me.

23:23.240 --> 23:23.970
Chief Zhang.

23:24.030 --> 23:24.910
Chief Zhang!

23:52.480 --> 23:53.280
Ye Jian...

23:59.070 --> 24:00.440
I killed Mr. Ye.

24:06.720 --> 24:07.920
Tell us more details.

24:11.480 --> 24:15.420
♪ Throw, throw, throw the handkerchief ♪

24:15.510 --> 24:17.880
♪ Secretly put it ♪

24:17.900 --> 24:20.350
♪ Behind the kid ♪

24:18.840 --> 24:22.370
[Lu Yibo]

24:20.550 --> 24:24.200
♪ Everyone, don't tell him ♪

24:24.750 --> 24:27.120
♪ Hurry up and catch him ♪

24:27.350 --> 24:28.750
Bowen, you've got a call.

24:30.270 --> 24:30.790
Bowen!

24:33.030 --> 24:34.200
♪ Throw ♪

24:34.200 --> 24:34.640
Hello?

24:35.030 --> 24:35.640
It's me!

24:36.270 --> 24:36.830
Ye Jian!

24:38.270 --> 24:39.000
Tell me

24:39.890 --> 24:41.710
where you were the night Chief Lu

24:42.510 --> 24:43.510
had his accident.

24:45.480 --> 24:46.640
Ye is our friend. That's true.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.870
But Ye is also a cop.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.000
You broke the law.

24:49.050 --> 24:50.780
Do you think Ye would let you go?

24:51.270 --> 24:52.350
Did you have this watch

24:52.350 --> 24:53.350
on the day Lu Zheng died?

24:53.350 --> 24:54.750
Even though the police
know the watch is mine,

24:54.750 --> 24:55.920
they won't link Lu Zheng's case

24:55.920 --> 24:56.720
to us.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.020
I hired a hitman half a year ago.

24:58.020 --> 24:58.830
Why did you kill him?

24:58.830 --> 24:59.510
Lu Zheng's death

24:59.510 --> 25:00.790
is a good thing for us.

25:00.790 --> 25:02.720
He was the Chief
of the Public Security Bureau!

25:02.720 --> 25:04.450
Ye Jian didn't notice it was me.

25:06.240 --> 25:07.070
He said

25:07.070 --> 25:09.070
the CCTV caught my brother's watch.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.550
At that time, I believed

25:11.550 --> 25:13.280
my brother had killed Lu Zheng.

25:14.350 --> 25:16.030
Let's meet and talk face to face.

25:16.030 --> 25:17.480
Let's meet by the small river
we used to swim in

25:17.480 --> 25:18.610
when we were little.

25:18.960 --> 25:20.560
I'll leave for it right away.

25:45.350 --> 25:47.000
What's that?

25:48.070 --> 25:49.510
I made it

25:49.510 --> 25:51.440
for the robot combat competition.

25:54.640 --> 25:56.100
I had never killed anyone.

25:57.830 --> 25:59.560
So I could only use this method.

26:17.240 --> 26:17.920
Yangyang?

26:20.830 --> 26:22.200
Why is it you?

26:29.070 --> 26:30.860
How come it's you?

28:23.200 --> 28:24.440
Two days ago, Zhou Rong asked my brother

28:24.440 --> 28:25.700
to trade for the phone.

28:27.720 --> 28:29.320
My brother didn't want to go.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.140
Go

28:35.480 --> 28:36.870
a little further later.

28:37.030 --> 28:38.000
Find a payphone

28:38.020 --> 28:39.150
and call the police.

28:39.550 --> 28:41.950
No matter what,
don't tell them who you are.

28:41.960 --> 28:42.880
Tell the police

28:42.880 --> 28:44.070
about the phone deal.

28:44.070 --> 28:45.590
If the police catch those two first,

28:45.590 --> 28:46.480
we'll be safe.

28:47.200 --> 28:48.000
Do you hear me?

28:49.680 --> 28:50.480
No way, Bowen.

28:51.920 --> 28:52.750
Why?

28:56.480 --> 28:57.510
I killed Ye Jian.

28:59.830 --> 29:00.820
What did you say?

29:01.400 --> 29:02.400
I killed Ye Jian.

29:02.400 --> 29:03.930
I drove and hit him to death.

29:06.640 --> 29:07.640
Do you think I'll let you go

29:07.640 --> 29:08.640
if you say this?

29:08.920 --> 29:10.980
You killed someone. You're amazing.

29:17.640 --> 29:18.240
Yangyang.

29:20.000 --> 29:22.000
Don't joke about this kind of thing.

29:27.960 --> 29:29.190
Why?

29:30.550 --> 29:32.170
I thought you killed Lu Zheng,

29:32.170 --> 29:33.970
and Jian had found out about you.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.630
Which car did you drive to hit him?

30:02.630 --> 30:03.270
The SUV.

30:04.310 --> 30:04.980
Where's the car?

30:04.980 --> 30:06.060
In the parking lot.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.210
Where did you hit him?

30:07.210 --> 30:07.920
By the river

30:07.920 --> 30:08.880
we used to swim in.

30:08.880 --> 30:09.810
What time was it?

30:09.920 --> 30:10.590
11:30 PM.

30:10.680 --> 30:11.480
Did anyone see you?

30:11.480 --> 30:12.040
No.

30:12.070 --> 30:13.670
There were just the two of us.

30:25.960 --> 30:26.530
Lili,

30:27.590 --> 30:29.200
book the earliest flight

30:29.200 --> 30:30.730
to Mankesid for my brother.

30:34.830 --> 30:35.590
Once we book the ticket,

30:35.590 --> 30:37.120
you'll leave immediately.

30:37.680 --> 30:38.680
If anyone asks,

30:39.110 --> 30:40.960
just say you want to go there early

30:40.960 --> 30:43.000
for house rental and other procedures.

30:43.000 --> 30:43.960
Bowen, I can't leave.

30:43.960 --> 30:45.480
You're going to leave anyway.

30:45.480 --> 30:46.790
You're just leaving early.

30:46.790 --> 30:47.720
I can't leave you alone

30:47.720 --> 30:48.270
here.

30:48.350 --> 30:49.160
Why are you staying here?

30:49.160 --> 30:50.020
Waiting to die?

30:53.640 --> 30:54.550
If I leave, what about you?

30:54.550 --> 30:56.110
I'm going to trade for the phone.

30:56.110 --> 30:57.160
Once those two bastards take the money

30:57.160 --> 30:58.110
and get out of Sanjiangkou,

30:58.110 --> 30:59.050
we'll be fine.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.030
What if they don't leave?

31:00.030 --> 31:04.490
-What if the police find out about this?
-Then I'll take the fall for killing him!

31:09.110 --> 31:09.590
No way.

31:10.830 --> 31:12.030
I must turn myself in.

31:13.440 --> 31:14.440
Turn yourself in?

31:21.000 --> 31:22.070
Even if that happens,

31:22.070 --> 31:23.310
I'll be fine.

31:24.790 --> 31:26.720
I'll admit that I killed him first.

31:27.310 --> 31:28.240
When your plane takes off,

31:28.240 --> 31:29.680
I'll change my statement.

31:29.680 --> 31:31.170
I have solid evidence

31:31.270 --> 31:33.070
that it has nothing to do with me.

31:33.880 --> 31:34.270
You'll be

31:34.270 --> 31:35.400
abroad then.

31:36.160 --> 31:37.570
Even if they suspect you,

31:38.110 --> 31:39.110
it'll be too late.

31:42.830 --> 31:43.430
Yangyang.

31:45.030 --> 31:46.190
Our Lang family

31:46.550 --> 31:48.080
has accumulated the merits

31:48.200 --> 31:50.130
to have a college student like you.

31:51.310 --> 31:53.240
I can't let anything happen to you.

31:56.440 --> 31:57.480
I'm sorry, Bowen.

31:59.070 --> 31:59.900
I'm sorry.

32:00.000 --> 32:00.600
It's okay.

32:11.480 --> 32:12.880
You have a bright future.

32:14.200 --> 32:14.800
Why did you

32:15.070 --> 32:16.530
get involved in this mess?

32:23.400 --> 32:24.490
That's my brother.

32:25.680 --> 32:27.240
I can do anything for him.

32:29.880 --> 32:30.720
When I was 9,

32:30.720 --> 32:32.320
my parents had a car accident

32:33.000 --> 32:33.920
and passed away.

32:33.920 --> 32:34.480
He is

32:34.480 --> 32:35.610
my only family left.

32:38.880 --> 32:40.440
"Sticking together for survival" might be

32:40.440 --> 32:41.900
just an idiom for you guys.

32:42.790 --> 32:44.270
You can say it easily without thinking

32:44.270 --> 32:45.600
about its deep meaning.

32:52.200 --> 32:54.460
But it's different for my brother and me.

33:00.830 --> 33:02.090
You won't understand.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.600
Taking others' lives

33:06.790 --> 33:08.990
to help you stick together for survival

33:11.110 --> 33:12.640
is what I can't understand.

33:17.790 --> 33:18.590
Take him away.

33:44.030 --> 33:44.760
Chief Zhang.

33:49.880 --> 33:51.160
Can I see my brother?

33:55.400 --> 33:55.830
No.

34:03.670 --> 34:06.730
I killed... I killed Ye Jian!

34:07.510 --> 34:08.590
Chief Zhang!

34:08.840 --> 34:10.469
I want to see Chief Zhang!

34:10.550 --> 34:11.530
Chief Zhang!

34:11.590 --> 34:13.590
I killed Ye Jian! I...

34:16.400 --> 34:17.130
Chief Zhang,

34:17.760 --> 34:19.159
I killed Ye Jian. Really.

34:19.690 --> 34:21.510
It has nothing to do with Yangyang.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.730
Please let him go.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.690
I'm begging you.

34:29.110 --> 34:29.800
Chief Zhang,

34:29.800 --> 34:30.440
please.

34:34.320 --> 34:34.920
Stand up.

34:36.210 --> 34:38.409
You will see no one if you don't stand up.

34:49.070 --> 34:49.710
Yangyang!

34:50.590 --> 34:51.510
Yangyang!

34:52.360 --> 34:53.100
I'm here!

34:54.179 --> 34:55.400
I'm here!

35:01.000 --> 35:01.730
Yangyang...

35:03.230 --> 35:04.090
-Let's go.
-Go.

35:14.260 --> 35:16.030
Sorry, Yangyang.

35:24.550 --> 35:25.990
I'm sorry.

35:33.630 --> 35:34.690
It's finally over.

35:41.030 --> 35:41.510
What?

35:42.360 --> 35:43.110
I'd like to thank you on behalf

35:43.110 --> 35:44.510
of everyone in the public security system

35:44.510 --> 35:45.440
of Sanjiangkou.

35:50.070 --> 35:50.930
What time is it?

35:51.690 --> 35:52.750
What time is it now?

35:54.510 --> 35:55.480
What's the matter?

35:55.480 --> 35:56.710
Take me to the hospital.

35:56.710 --> 35:57.600
I need an IV.

35:58.400 --> 35:58.930
Let's go.

36:00.150 --> 36:00.630
Be careful.

36:00.630 --> 36:01.160
I'm fine.

36:13.900 --> 36:16.730
[Two months later]

36:25.480 --> 36:27.070
I almost forgot my shoes.

36:30.280 --> 36:30.760
Zhang.

36:31.360 --> 36:32.510
Is it really appropriate for us

36:32.510 --> 36:33.510
to leave quietly?

36:33.550 --> 36:34.550
We came quietly,

36:35.190 --> 36:37.050
just like we're leaving quietly.

36:37.550 --> 36:38.840
Parting is always sad.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.650
We can't leave quietly.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.070
Yi'ang.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.450
Why didn't you tell us you were leaving?

36:47.450 --> 36:48.580
We know everything.

36:49.480 --> 36:50.410
What do you know?

36:50.710 --> 36:52.280
You're transferred back
to the provincial capital.

36:52.280 --> 36:53.400
It hasn't been announced yet.

36:53.400 --> 36:54.080
We know

36:54.280 --> 36:55.190
an amazing detective like you

36:55.190 --> 36:56.920
can't stay in this small place.

36:57.150 --> 36:57.790
Yi'ang,

36:58.070 --> 36:58.760
Sanjiangkou

36:58.760 --> 37:00.280
has been a lucky place for you.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.540
If you agree,

37:01.760 --> 37:03.620
I'll call Director Gao right away

37:03.630 --> 37:04.320
to ask for his permission.

37:04.320 --> 37:04.800
No need.

37:07.400 --> 37:07.920
Yi'ang,

37:09.110 --> 37:11.640
on behalf of all the colleagues
in the bureau,

37:12.800 --> 37:13.800
I want you to stay.

37:15.880 --> 37:18.150
I'm sincerely asking you to stay.

37:21.110 --> 37:21.880
Why does this scene

37:21.880 --> 37:23.280
seem kind of familiar?

37:25.800 --> 37:28.130
Looks like Chief Zhang can't leave again.

37:28.400 --> 37:30.130
A land that doesn't belong to me

37:30.840 --> 37:32.500
is always worth remembering.

37:33.150 --> 37:33.610
Well...

37:34.110 --> 37:35.710
You should know when to quit.

37:36.230 --> 37:37.690
W-What do you mean by this?

37:42.700 --> 37:43.990
[Building 2]

37:56.880 --> 37:58.020
Nothing hurts

37:58.110 --> 37:58.880
more than

37:58.880 --> 38:00.250
an untold story

38:00.320 --> 38:01.520
hidden in your heart.

38:25.360 --> 38:26.560
Congratulations...

38:30.150 --> 38:32.800
On your glorious return
to the Provincial Department.

38:32.800 --> 38:34.540
It's not easy to work
in the Criminal Investigation Corps.

38:34.540 --> 38:35.590
Yes, yes.

38:34.620 --> 38:41.300
[Building 2]

38:38.070 --> 38:39.330
Since you're all here,

38:40.110 --> 38:41.840
let's officially say goodbye.

38:42.150 --> 38:43.950
During the days at Sanjiangkou,

38:45.360 --> 38:46.110
your support

38:46.110 --> 38:46.960
for me at work

38:48.880 --> 38:49.960
is something I will

38:50.840 --> 38:51.900
never ever forget.

38:56.670 --> 38:57.270
Comrades,

38:58.230 --> 38:59.490
see you again someday.

39:11.150 --> 39:11.750
Thank you.

39:12.030 --> 39:12.720
Take care.

39:17.840 --> 39:18.360
Li.

39:19.150 --> 39:19.680
Chief Qi.

39:20.380 --> 39:22.380
You're always welcome to come back.

39:22.510 --> 39:23.480
You are the best partner

39:23.480 --> 39:24.460
I've ever met.

39:26.400 --> 39:27.460
Don't tell Li Qian.

39:34.070 --> 39:36.800
We couldn't have solved
these cases without you.

39:39.630 --> 39:40.360
I'm leaving.

39:41.960 --> 39:42.360
Bye.

39:42.400 --> 39:42.880
Bye.

39:43.670 --> 39:44.330
Yi'ang.

39:45.880 --> 39:47.080
In a moment like this,

39:47.230 --> 39:49.290
don't you want to recite a poem again?

39:57.590 --> 39:59.580
"If life deceives you,

40:00.920 --> 40:01.840
don't be sad

40:02.510 --> 40:03.570
and don't rush.

40:04.590 --> 40:06.430
Joyful days will surely come."

40:17.110 --> 40:18.250
Chief Qi,

40:18.440 --> 40:20.000
what did Chief Zhang tell you

40:20.000 --> 40:21.530
that made you laugh so much?

40:23.000 --> 40:23.800
It's a secret.

40:24.550 --> 40:26.840
How painful it is
to keep a secret to yourself?

40:26.840 --> 40:27.760
What is Chief Zhang's new position

40:27.760 --> 40:28.630
back in the CI Corps?

40:28.630 --> 40:29.430
It's a secret.

40:38.680 --> 40:42.620
[Another two months later]

40:51.400 --> 40:52.510
[Logistics Service]

40:54.010 --> 40:55.680
[Logistics Service]

40:55.000 --> 40:55.480
Zhang!

40:56.670 --> 40:58.460
[Logistics Service]

40:57.230 --> 40:57.830
Come on in.

40:57.960 --> 40:58.360
You...

40:59.320 --> 41:00.070
Well,

41:00.190 --> 41:02.600
the ink box of the printer.

41:08.150 --> 41:08.810
The ink box.

41:10.150 --> 41:10.670
Thank you.

41:10.670 --> 41:11.130
Come on.

41:11.840 --> 41:13.280
By the way, I brought you a box of tea.

41:12.780 --> 41:14.640
[Liu'an Melon Slices]

41:15.960 --> 41:17.160
You did it on purpose?

41:17.630 --> 41:18.290
Testing me?

41:19.820 --> 41:21.020
Liu'an melon slices.

41:23.110 --> 41:23.710
Thank you.

41:24.590 --> 41:25.520
You're not busy?

41:25.670 --> 41:26.870
Stay with me for a bit.

41:39.550 --> 41:40.920
We've been back
for almost two months, right?

41:40.920 --> 41:42.380
Two months and three days.

41:49.280 --> 41:50.710
Do you want to go back to the front line?

41:50.710 --> 41:51.320
Yes, sure.

41:52.190 --> 41:54.110
But one should build up strength
before making a move

41:54.110 --> 41:55.510
and not rush for rewards.

41:56.400 --> 41:57.480
We should also give young people like you

41:57.480 --> 41:58.190
more opportunities

41:58.190 --> 41:59.030
to grow well.

42:02.190 --> 42:03.190
How have you been?

42:03.480 --> 42:05.010
What cases have you solved?

42:05.440 --> 42:06.440
They're all small cases.

42:06.440 --> 42:07.190
No big ones.

42:09.110 --> 42:11.960
Someone who has solved big cases
is indeed different.

42:11.960 --> 42:12.800
Don't rush.

42:13.920 --> 42:14.850
Wait patiently.

42:17.510 --> 42:19.370
Just like this drinking machine.

42:20.670 --> 42:21.880
The logistics center has one;

42:21.880 --> 42:22.540
CID has one;

42:22.630 --> 42:23.880
the Director's office has one;

42:23.880 --> 42:25.920
the Veteran Cadre Bureau also has one.

42:25.920 --> 42:27.120
It may look ordinary,

42:27.630 --> 42:28.960
but it never slacks off.

42:30.710 --> 42:31.630
Wherever it is,

42:32.320 --> 42:33.380
it will stand still

42:33.880 --> 42:35.210
and always be prepared.

42:36.110 --> 42:37.910
Maybe the position is ordinary,

42:37.920 --> 42:39.180
and the duty is normal,

42:39.840 --> 42:41.480
but this is its mission.

42:40.880 --> 42:43.530
[Police]

42:42.550 --> 42:44.610
As long as the organization needs it,

42:45.030 --> 42:46.290
it can heat up quickly,

42:47.800 --> 42:49.010
giving light in its heart

42:49.010 --> 42:50.160
to the people,

42:51.590 --> 42:53.450
and offering the burning passion

42:53.760 --> 42:55.070
to the public security cause.
